    "P2559": [
      {
        "id": "P3452$61418715-49ad-fffa-8276-5b4980a6ebcf",
        "mainsnak": {
          "datatype": "monolingualtext",
          "datavalue": {
            "type": "monolingualtext",
            "value": {
              "language": "de",
              "text": "Diese Eigenschaft gibt an, dass die Informationen aus einem anderen Datenobjekt stammen. Zur Angabe einer anderen Informationensquelle (einem Buch, einem Artikel usw.) kann die Eigenschaft P248 (nachgewiesen in) verwendet werden."
            }
          },
          "hash": "aec6273cc3d55b93392ca8fa04f160f794cedc47",
          "property": "P2559",
          "snaktype": "value"
        },
        "rank": "normal",
        "type": "statement"
      },
      {
        "id": "P3452$5eb9bdcb-4c12-8d7c-b4eb-673576d7ba51",
        "mainsnak": {
          "datatype": "monolingualtext",
          "datavalue": {
            "type": "monolingualtext",
            "value": {
              "language": "fr",
              "text": "à utiliser uniquement dans le champ référence"
            }
          },
          "hash": "0d0cef4c4d96e3a7c2e77380f85dc0961df57343",
          "property": "P2559",
          "snaktype": "value"
        },
        "rank": "normal",
        "type": "statement"
      },
      {
        "id": "P3452$71f4d9eb-4681-a814-015f-364913f502b8",
        "mainsnak": {
          "datatype": "monolingualtext",
          "datavalue": {
            "type": "monolingualtext",
            "value": {
              "language": "en",
              "text": "This property indicates that the information is contained within the provided item itself, as part of its statements. If you want to express that the information is contained by the entity (a book, an article, etc) that's represented by the linked information source, use P248."
            }
          },
          "hash": "8a67818492c0b35656d28fe858c27ca018a4b7c9",
          "property": "P2559",
          "snaktype": "value"
        },
        "rank": "normal",
        "type": "statement"
      },
      {
        "id": "P3452$562c87ae-4158-b65e-acad-79fbcc28e674",
        "mainsnak": {
          "datatype": "monolingualtext",
          "datavalue": {
            "type": "monolingualtext",
            "value": {
              "language": "nb",
              "text": "Brukes kun i referansefeltet"
            }
          },
          "hash": "bd236e0a1e69d3fb19dc38221fca42c36f2147da",
          "property": "P2559",
          "snaktype": "value"
        },
        "rank": "normal",
        "type": "statement"
      },
      {
        "id": "P3452$7d5250a4-4886-4dbe-6279-95577571e7b7",
        "mainsnak": {
          "datatype": "monolingualtext",
          "datavalue": {
            "type": "monolingualtext",
            "value": {
              "language": "es",
              "text": "Esta propiedad indica que la información está contenida en el propio elemento proporcionado, como parte de sus declaraciones. Si desea expresar que la información está contenida en la entidad (un libro, un artículo, etc.) representada por la fuente de información enlazada, utilice P248."
            }
          },
          "hash": "220c44f1a1118aacbf4fdf97d32575d6088ece61",
          "property": "P2559",
          "snaktype": "value"
        },
        "rank": "normal",
        "type": "statement"
      },
      {
        "id": "P3452$cd571c83-4ecc-5616-c9c2-fa90cb2df8fe",
        "mainsnak": {
          "datatype": "monolingualtext",
          "datavalue": {
            "type": "monolingualtext",
            "value": {
              "language": "gl",
              "text": "Esta propiedade indica que a información está tomada do propio elemento. Se desexa expresar que a información está contida na entidade (un libro, un artigo etc.)  representada pola fonte de información ligada, use P248 (fonte de información relacionada co elemento)"
            }
          },
          "hash": "98807b7069b96cf5cf3efa2cd3668b65d3dacfa3",
          "property": "P2559",
          "snaktype": "value"
        },
        "rank": "normal",
        "type": "statement"
      },
      {
        "id": "P3452$49ad7aca-4b46-8894-993d-c776fde44aa1",
        "mainsnak": {
          "datatype": "monolingualtext",
          "datavalue": {
            "type": "monolingualtext",
            "value": {
              "language": "fi",
              "text": "Tämä ominaisuus ilmaisee, että informaatio sisältyy kohteeseen. Käytä P248, jos haluat ilmaista, että informaatio sisältyy entiteettiin (kirja, artikkeli, tms.), jota linkitetty lähde edustaa."
            }
          },
          "hash": "fd83703a4c2152ee599ada92f710a90dd3a61b49",
          "property": "P2559",
          "snaktype": "value"
        },
        "rank": "normal",
        "type": "statement"
      },
      {
        "id": "P3452$ea505fc2-4134-6c96-e68e-966c7213b716",
        "mainsnak": {
          "datatype": "monolingualtext",
          "datavalue": {
            "type": "monolingualtext",
            "value": {
              "language": "ca",
              "text": "Aquesta propietat indica que la informació es troba a l'element. Si voleu expressar que la informació està continguda per l'entitat (un llibre, un article, etc.) que està representada per la font d'informació enllaçada, utilitzeu P248."
            }
          },
          "hash": "d0b19ad9dd822268d1019548236690dad7fdd1a1",
          "property": "P2559",
          "snaktype": "value"
        },
        "rank": "normal",
        "type": "statement"
      },
      {
        "id": "P3452$c1a956a6-4ef1-7a1c-6bb2-7091da605ba9",
        "mainsnak": {
          "datatype": "monolingualtext",
          "datavalue": {
            "type": "monolingualtext",
            "value": {
              "language": "zh",
              "text": "此属性表明信息包含在所提供的项目本身中，作为其陈述的一部分。如果您想表达信息包含在链接信息源所代表的实体（例如书籍、文章等）中，请使用 P248。"
            }
          },
          "hash": "bce03df1f8de21bd49ecf5da63d6d7f8eb4a60af",
          "property": "P2559",
          "snaktype": "value"
        },
        "rank": "normal",
        "type": "statement"
      }
    ],
